---
layout: base.njk
title: Advertise on WireMyLife
description: Featured listings at $49 a month, newsletter sponsorship at $99 an issue, and category sponsorship at $149 a month. Status badges are not for sale.
---
<h1>Get featured</h1>
<p class="lead">Put your connector in front of people choosing how to connect a car or a home to Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, or Grok.</p>
<div class="tiers">
{% for tier in site.tiers %}
  <article class="tier" id="{{ tier.id }}">
    <h2>{{ tier.name }}</h2>
    <p class="price">{{ tier.price }}<span>{{ tier.period }}</span></p>
    <p>{{ tier.summary }}</p>
    <ul>{% for point in tier.points %}<li>{{ point }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    <a class="btn" href="{{ tier.href }}"{% if not tier.isMailto %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>Buy</a>
    {% if not tier.isMailto %}<a class="questions" href="{{ tier.questionsHref }}">Questions? Email us</a>{% endif %}
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
<p>Listing a connector is still free. Payment never changes a status badge. Featured listings and sponsors are always labelled. <a href="/disclosure/">Read the disclosure</a> · <a href="/how-we-check/">how the badges work</a> · <a href="/submit/">submit a free listing</a>.</p>
